          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>An unloved office storage room was transformed into a sophisticated Chicago speakeasy-inspired games room, lounge, coffee/working bar, and dining space. Designed for seamless day-to-night use, the rich green, walnut, and black palette, layered lighting, and versatile zoning create a warm, professional yet social atmosphere for staff, clients, and private entertaining.</p>",
